'''Momma Meepster''' is a meep [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found near the Big J's, located in [[Snowhill]].

==Misplaced Meeps==
Momma Meepster hosts a [[Quests|quest]] called [[Quest:Misplaced Meeps|Misplaced Meeps]] in which the player is sent to locate her baby "[[Lost Meep|Meeps]]" which are scattered across the [[Sacred Grove]].

After completion of the Misplaced Meeps quest, Momma Meepster introduces the opportunity to adopt a [[Meep]] [[Pet Pals|Pet Pal]] for the regular price of {{Coin|25,000}} and to [[Membership|Members]] at the 10% discount price of {{Coin|22,500}}. 

